<title>SENEGAL: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO/AFRICAN ZONE GROUP THREE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO/AFRICAN ZONE GROUP THREE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DAKAR 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the final day of</p>
<p>competition in Davis Cup Euro/African zone group three on</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>Luxemburg beat Senegal 2-1</p>
<p>Pascal Schaul (Luxemburg) beat Jean Noel Said (Senegal 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Yahiya Doumbia (Senegal) beat Sacha Thoma (luxemburg) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Adrian Graimprey/Johnny Goudenbour (Luxemburg) beat Yahiya</p>
<p>Doumbia/Thierno Ly (Senegal) 7-6 7-6</p>
<p>Turkey beat Macedonia 2-1</p>
<p>Mustapha Azara (Turkey) beat Goran Popov (Macedonia) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Zoran Sevcenko (Macedonia) beat Baris Ergun (Turkey) 6-7  6-2</p>
<p>8-6</p>
<p>Mustapha Azkara/Erhan Oral (Turkey) beat Lazar Magdincev/Zoran</p>
<p>Sevcenko (Macedonia) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Bosnia beat San Marino 3-0</p>
<p>Eldar Mustafic (Bosnia) beat Christian Rosti San Marino) 7-5</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Merid Zahirovic (Bosnia) beat Domenico Vicini (San Marino) 7-6</p>
<p>7-6</p>
<p>Haris Basalic/Eldar Mustafic (Bosnia) beat Gabriel</p>
<p>Francini/Domenico Vicini (San Marino) 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>-Armenia beat Ethiopia: 2-1</p>
<p>Artak Harutyunyan (Armenia) beat Samuel Gebriel (Ethiopia) 6-2</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Yohannes Setegne (Ethiopia) beat David Babayan (Armenia) 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Artak Harutyunyan/Anri Makichian (Armenia) beat Samuel</p>
<p>Gebriel/Yohanness Setegne (Ethiopia) 6-4 6-2</p>
</text>
